#typyst

ty - TYpewriter
py - by PYzozord
st - based on ST suckless terminal

st is a simple terminal emulator for X which sucks less.

Requirements
------------
In order to build st you need the Xlib header files.

Installation
------------
make build && make install

Running st
----------
If you did not install typyst with make install, you must compile the terminfo entry with the following command:

    tic -sx tic.info

